  "question": "Let $d_1,d_2,\\ldots,d_k$ be all the factors of a positive integer $n$ including 1 and $n$. Suppose $d_1+d_2+\\cdots+d_k=72$. Then the value of\n\\[\n\\frac1{d_1}+\\frac1{d_2}+\\cdots+\\frac1{d_k}\n\\]\n",
  "options": {
    "A": "$\\frac{k^2}{72}$;",
    "B": "$\\frac{72}{k}$;",
    "C": "$\\frac{72}{n}$;",
    "D": "cannot be computed."
  },
  "answer": "C",
